 "name": "SUZUKI.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "The new Gundam.",
  "Its name was Gundam NT-1",
  "Alex.",
  "\"Alex\" was",
  "a code name for Amuro.",
  "Amuro, no show-off in anything,",
  "kept even the personal mark",
  "on his machine plain,",
  "using nothing but his own initial,",
  "the letter A,",
  "and so",
  "the new machine's name",
  "was made to match it.",
  "This machine was built",
  "to give a hero a machine",
  "worthy of a hero.",
  "Revil had been eager to have",
  "White Base test new weapons,",
  "and now that things",
  "had come to this,",
  "if from the outset they built,",
  "around Amuro as a person,",
  "a machine just for him,",
  "even greater results might follow--",
  "or so he had come to think.",
  "This idea itself,",
  "far in the future--",
  "14 years later, to be exact--",
  "would be realized by Amuro himself",
  "in the form of the Nu Gundam.",
  "But at this point,",
  "Amuro, in the end,",
  "never got to pilot the Alex.",
  "A unit operating",
  "separately from Char's",
  "got in the way."
 ]
}
